<title>USA: Suzuki July US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Suzuki July US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suzuki Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Jul 1-31, 1997     Jul 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		  65		 154	    -57.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	     506	     1,034	    -51.1</p>
<p> Import Car		   372		 571	    -34.9</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,436	     1,086	    +32.2</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jul 31, 1997 Jan 1-Jul 31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car		 853	     2,368	    -63.8</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   2,896	     5,089	    -42.8</p>
<p> Import Car		 4,437	     3,764	    +18.5</p>
<p> Import Truck	     8,934	     8,215	     +9.4</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month  vs 26, 179 for year to date vs 180 in year ago.</p>
</text>
